StudyHub Adaptive Notification Engine — Full Production Implementation Prompt

Project Context

I am building StudyHub, an Android-first study management application for Bangladeshi SSC, HSC, and admission students.

Implement a complete, adaptive notification engine in my existing project. It should behave like a funny, intelligent study buddy that helps students reduce distraction, return to their studies, maintain healthy study habits, and stay aware of important academic tasks.

The notification personality should be funny, witty, friendly, occasionally mischievous, and genuinely useful. The presentation can be humorous, but the underlying information and scheduling must be accurate.

Do not merely describe the solution or generate a mockup. Inspect the existing project and implement the feature in the actual codebase.

Preserve the existing StudyHub design, light theme, navigation, profile system, data, and unrelated features.

