PART 8 — Architecture and Data Integrity

Keep the engine modular. Adapt names to the existing project rather than blindly introducing duplicate layers.

Suggested responsibilities:

- NotificationContentRepository: bundled predefined messages.
- NotificationEligibilityService: user context and constraints.
- AdaptiveNotificationEngine: scoring and selection.
